# Rust style

- Edition 2021; use workspace deps from root `Cargo.toml`
- Libraries: `thiserror` via `vd_common::Error`; binaries may use `anyhow`
- `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]` unless crate is `vd-capture`, `vd-codec`, or `vd-input`
- Every `unsafe` block needs `// SAFETY:` explaining invariants
- Prefer explicit `Result` over panics in libraries
- No `todo!()` / `unimplemented!()` on code paths run by tests — return `Error::NotImplemented`
- Document public traits and types with rustdoc
- Run `cargo fmt`; clippy workspace lints must stay clean (`-D warnings` in CI)
